<div>
  <div dir="rtl">
    <div style="
      background-color: var(--dialog-scrim-color-show);
      bottom: 0px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      left: 0px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      overflow-y: hidden;
      position: fixed;
      right: 0px;
      top: 0px;
      will-change: background-color;
      z-index: 100000
    ">
      <div style="
        background-color: var(--dialog-window-background-color, var(--color-background-primary));
        border-right-color: rgba(153, 153, 153, 0.18);
        border-right-style: solid;
        border-right-width: 1px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex-grow: 1;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        min-height: 55px;
        overflow-y: auto;
        width: 100%;
        will-change: opacity, transform
      ">
        <div style="
          display: flex;
          flex-shrink: 0;
          margin: var(--spacing-200) var(--spacing-200) 0;
          position: relative
        ">
          <h2 style="
            align-self: center;
            flex-grow: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0px;
            margin-top: 0px;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere
          ">
            Left Panel
          </h2>
          <button style="
            align-items: center;
            align-self: flex-start;
            background-color: var(--color-background-secondary);
            border-bottom-color: currentcolor;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 50px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 50px;
            border-bottom-style: none;
            border-bottom-width: 0px;
            border-left-color: currentcolor;
            border-left-style: none;
            border-left-width: 0px;
            border-right-color: currentcolor;
            border-right-style: none;
            border-right-width: 0px;
            border-top-color: currentcolor;
            border-top-left-radius: 50px;
            border-top-right-radius: 50px;
            border-top-style: none;
            border-top-width: 0px;
            display: inline-flex;
            font-family: inherit;
            height: 32px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-inline-start: var(--spacing-200);
            min-width: 32px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            overflow-y: hidden;
            padding-bottom: 0px;
            padding-left: 0px;
            padding-right: 0px;
            padding-top: 0px;
            position: relative;
            vertical-align: text-bottom;
            width: 32px;
            z-index: 1
          ">
            <style>@scope{:scope{
              &::after {
                background-color: var(--color-state-layer-neutral);
                border-bottom-left-radius: 50px;
                border-bottom-right-radius: 50px;
                border-top-left-radius: 50px;
                border-top-right-radius: 50px;
                bottom: 0px;
                content: "";
                left: 0px;
                pointer-events: none;
                position: absolute;
                right: 0px;
                top: 0px
              }
            }}</style>
            <svg style="
              display: inline-block;
              fill: var(--color-foreground-primary);
              height: 16px;
              max-width: 75%;
              pointer-events: none;
              position: relative;
              stroke-width: 0;
              stroke: currentcolor;
              vertical-align: middle;
              width: 16px
            ">
              <use href="#icon-close-16"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div style="
          box-sizing: border-box;
          flex-grow: 1;
          height: 1px;
          overflow-y: auto;
          padding: var(--spacing-200);
          position: relative
        ">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0px">
            Heading
          </h3>
          <p>
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus convallis molestie erat, ut adipiscing risus blandit vel. Vivamus luctus elementum lorem, eu sodales velit sagittis id.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a style="color: var(--color-foreground-link-primary)">
              www.ebay.com
            </a>
          </p>
          <h3>
            Heading
          </h3>
